    "attributes": {
        "action": "Immediately close all asylum hotels & deport all illegal migrants living there",
        "additional_details": "It has transpired that these hotels may stay open until 2029. We want these hotels shut down immediately, and to immediately deport any migrants or asylum seekers who are being housed there and came to the UK illegally.",
        "background": "The Government pledged to close down asylum hotels in its manifesto for the 2024 General Election.",
